      "content": "It sounds like you might indeed be experiencing a migraine aura, often coupled with a migraine headache. Rest in a dark, quiet room, and try applying a cool cloth to your head. Over-the-counter pain relievers like ibuprofen and acetaminophen can help alleviate headache and pain. Make sure you hydrate and try to eat lightly if you can. If these symptoms are new or particularly severe, it's important to consult a healthcare provider to rule out other potential issues. Stay calm; these symptoms should pass, but don't ignore them altogether.",
