    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, a stroke?? that seems way too extreme for just a bad migraine. ive had these before and they always go away with rest. plus i really dont have the money or time for an er visit right now. if i just take a higher dose of ibuprofen, like maybe 1000mg or 1200mg all at once, do you think that would help kill the pain and the weakness faster so i can just sleep? i just need to know if that's safe to do so i can get through the night.",
